10. get_slos
   Description: Returns SLOs for the current team. Can show either a list or detailed view of a single SLO.

LIST VIEW (when slo_id not provided):
Returns a formatted markdown table with:
- Name, Description, Target, Time Period
- Status (✓ Normal, ⚠ Triggered, or - No Events)
- Compliance and Budget Remaining percentages
- Burn Alerts status and Tags

DETAILED VIEW (when slo_id provided):
Returns comprehensive details for a single SLO including:
- Configuration (target, time period, SLI column, datasets)
- Current status with explanation
- Budget Burndown graph: shows error budget consumption over time
- Historical Compliance graph: shows SLI success rate over time
- Burn rate analysis
- Configured burn alerts and their status
